== E. GB7: queries per exercised bit, with per-rule overhead bits included (q = 3) ==
   single-use rules cost n/4 (with deferral); rare exercised rules (2^j > n) cost n/4 (without deferral).
   bits of a rule = log2(1/P(j)) + j + log2 q.  "note" = the note's formula with J = log2(nT).
